&lt;p&gt;Find out more about Life at GoCardless via &lt;a href=&quot;http://twitter.com/GoCardlessEng&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://instagram.com/lifeatgocardless&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless is a global bank payment company. Over 100,000 businesses, from start-ups to household names, use GoCardless to collect, manage and send bank payments through Direct Debit, real-time payments and open banking. With US$130bn+ processed annually across 30+ countries, we handle recurring and one-off payments without the chasing, stress, or expensive fees. Our end-to-end payment platform also features AI-powered solutions to improve payment success and reduce fraud, alongside connections to over 350 platforms businesses use everyday.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are headquartered in the UK, with teams and operations spanning North America, Europe and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering at GoCardless&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The technical challenges of building GoCardless span from simplifying building banking schemes to optimising the time to render the dashboard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will enjoy being a Principal Software Engineer at GoCardless if:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re looking to champion a great engineering culture within GC and in the wider engineering community;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy collaborating and learning from people from various backgrounds and experiences;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to feel proud of the work you’re doing and its impact on real customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our engineers contribute to the engineering culture within and outside of GoCardless: they contribute to Open Source Software projects (see our&lt;a href=&quot;http://github.com/gocardless&quot;&gt; Github&lt;/a&gt;), and share learnings in&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/blog/service-outage-on-6-april-2018-post-mortem-results/&quot;&gt; post-mortems&lt;/a&gt;, conferences and on&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/blog/debugging-the-postgres-query-planner/&quot;&gt; our blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our technologies: We endeavour to build simple, reliable systems and we believe in using the best technologies for each task.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technologies we use across GoCardless include: Ruby on Rails, Golang, Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, React, Postgres, BigQuery, Kubernetes, Elasticsearch, Prometheus, Google Cloud (GCP).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a new role based in Lisbon, created to strengthen the technical leadership within the Global Growth group. In this role you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture of our dashboard platform and the design system used across the company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring technical depth to de-risks our highest-impact initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical multiplier for engineers across multiple teams — all while staying hands-on enough to lead the hardest problems yourself.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report into engineering leadership for Global Growth and work alongside engineering managers in the group and Principal Engineers across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: You don&#39;t wait to be asked - you identify problems, develop options, and drive solutions. When you need help, you explicitly ask for it. You spot issues and either fix them or bring options to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Decision-Making&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;re ready to own technical decisions across multiple teams and escalate blocking issues effectively. This role has real authority and mandate, not just influence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;: You can see across the entire domain, understand interdependencies, and make architectural decisions that balance immediate needs with long-term flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication&lt;/strong&gt;: You communicate using metrics and data to support your recommendations, and you&#39;re comfortable presenting technical strategies to executives and working with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites us&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-stack engineering background&lt;/strong&gt; with deep front-end architecture experience and strong, hands-on back-end expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track record operating as a senior technical leader&lt;/strong&gt; across multiple teams: setting direction, mentoring other engineers, and being trusted by both engineers and senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — we work together across different parts of the organisation to achieve the best outcome possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatism&lt;/strong&gt; — we balance quality and time to delivery differently depending on the situation and business need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; — you can explain a technical trade-off to a non-technical stakeholder as easily as you can to another engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t expect you to meet every requirement. If you’re excited by this role, we encourage you to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
