&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission as the Payment Intelligence team is to augment our bank payments product with intelligent data products that differentiate our offering and increase our win rates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our focus areas are our existing products, Success+ and Protect+. This means creating market-leading payment recovery rates and fraud prevention products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Projects in the pipeline that align to these focus areas are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve payment recovery rates for failed Account to Account payments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the value proposition of our Payment Intelligence products for our merchants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead growth initiatives to increase the adoption of Success+ and Protect+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;As an engineer, you will be actively working on projects that help grow the adoption of these products while improving the experience of using the same and coming up with ideas for new product features in this space. You will be aided and supported in this journey by a cross functional team of super talented and motivated engineers and data scientists&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique and high-profile opportunity for you, as an engineer, to work on building one one of GoCardless&#39; major revenue streams in the coming years.&lt;/p&gt;
