&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Asian, Black, Mixed or Other — &lt;strong&gt;25%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Neurodiverse — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;LGBTQIA+ — &lt;strong&gt;9%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Disabled — &lt;strong&gt;1%&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Average age — &lt;strong&gt;33&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Female — &lt;strong&gt;45%&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Male —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt; 55%&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re rooting for you during your application and GoCardless aims to provide reasonable adjustments to make our recruitment process as remarkable and accessible as we can. Please speak to your Talent Partner if you need extra support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more, you can read about our Employee Resource Groups and objectives &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://gocardless.com/about/careers/&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1781014616204220&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1DeqgyeRfEwEzecwn4oq3j&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sustainability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re committed to reducing our impact on the environment, leaving a more sustainable world for future generations. Check out our sustainability &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://gocardless.com/sustainability/&amp;amp;sa=D&amp;amp;source=calendar&amp;amp;ust=1781014616204220&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0OQGUkwNEPbDW9lQb1uiAd&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;action plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about Life at GoCardless via &lt;a href=&quot;http://twitter.com/GoCardlessEng&quot;&gt;Twitter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;http://instagram.com/lifeatgocardless&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/gocardless&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GoCardless is a global bank payment company. Over 100,000 businesses, from start-ups to household names, use GoCardless to collect, manage and send bank payments through Direct Debit, real-time payments and open banking. With US$130bn+ processed annually across 30+ countries, we handle recurring and one-off payments without the chasing, stress, or expensive fees. Our end-to-end payment platform also features AI-powered solutions to improve payment success and reduce fraud, alongside connections to over 350 platforms businesses use everyday.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are headquartered in the UK, with teams and operations spanning North America, Europe and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a passionate &lt;strong&gt;Talent Acquisition Partner&lt;/strong&gt; to join our new hub in &lt;strong&gt;Lisbon&lt;/strong&gt;. You will be primarily responsible for driving the recruitment of exceptional talent across our Product Development (&lt;strong&gt;PD&lt;/strong&gt;) functions. This role requires a good understanding of the PD talent market and the ability to build strong relationships with both candidates and hiring managers. You will also have the opportunity to support the wider Talent Acquisition team with hiring across other global locations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate a hybrid work model, and this role will be based in our brand-new Lisbon office. You&#39;ll enjoy the best of both worlds: flexibility and the chance to collaborate in a brand new office environment with other GeeCees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Recruitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the full recruitment lifecycle for a variety of roles, from initial briefing to offer negotiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support Broader Hiring Needs:&lt;/strong&gt; When required, support recruitment efforts across PD and other functions such as Finance, Legal, People, and Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Talent Sourcing:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and execute effective sourcing strategies to identify and attract top-tier talent, utilising a variety of channels including online platforms, professional networks, local communities, and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer Branding &amp;amp; Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent GoCardless, building relationships with potential candidates and promoting our employer value proposition through networking, meetups, and other initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with hiring managers and leadership to understand their talent needs, provide market insights, and ensure a seamless and positive candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local Market Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage your deep understanding of the local talent market, including compensation benchmarks, competitor activity, and emerging trends, to inform recruitment strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the refinement of our recruitment processes and tools, ensuring efficiency, fairness, and a focus on candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Approach:&lt;/strong&gt; Track and analyse key recruitment metrics to identify areas for improvement and measure the effectiveness of your talent acquisition strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with the wider global Talent Acquisition team, sharing best practices and contributing to global talent initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to play a significant role in the growth of our growing and thriving hub in Lisbon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to focus on recruiting for impactful PD teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging your deep understanding of the PD talent landscape to attract exceptional individuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building strong relationships with hiring managers and contributing directly to their team&#39;s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being part of a collaborative and supportive global Talent Acquisition team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The prospect of contributing to the continued success of a rapidly growing FinTech company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What excites us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as an in-house Talent Acquisition Partner or Recruiter, with a track record of successfully hiring for Product Development roles (Software Development Engineers, Product Managers, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing the full recruitment lifecycle with direct sourcing skills and experience utilising various sourcing tools and techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, interpersonal, and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to build strong relationships at all levels.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven approach, using data and insights to support hiring strategies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to creating a positive and inclusive candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base salary range: € 24,000- € 36,000 (gross), (including 13th and 14th salary).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base salary ranges are based on role, job level, location, and market data.&amp;nbsp; Please note that whilst we strive to offer competitive compensation, our approach is to pay between &lt;strong&gt;the &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;minimum and the mid-point&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; (€ 24,000 - € 30,000)&lt;/strong&gt; of the pay range until performance can be assessed in role. Offers will take into account level of experience, interview assessment, budgets and parity between you and fellow employees at GoCardless doing similar work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(some of) The good stuff&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing &lt;/strong&gt;- stay healthy with dedicated support and medical cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work away scheme&lt;/strong&gt; - gives you the option to work away from your country of residence for up to 90 days in any 12 month period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Working&lt;/strong&gt; - allows you to work flexibly, around your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parental leave&lt;/strong&gt; - to suit everyone embarking on life&#39;s great adventure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt; - lead your own development with an annual learning budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time off&lt;/strong&gt; - generous holiday allowance, + 3 annual volunteer days, + 4 annual business-wide wellness days (‘GC Fridays’)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at GoCardless&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re an organisation defined by our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gocardless.com/g/values-operating-principles/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;; We &lt;em&gt;start with why &lt;/em&gt;before we begin any project, to ensure it’s aligned with our mission. We&lt;em&gt; act with integrity&lt;/em&gt;, always. We &lt;em&gt;care deeply&lt;/em&gt; about what we do and we know it&#39;s essential that we &lt;em&gt;be humble &lt;/em&gt;whilst we do it. Working this way creates the GC magic- the reason we all love showing up to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
